      "message": "test(fixtures): pin the carried-stock mesh reading's clearing paths\n\nThe review's post and lip between the column lines are refused; an open\nmesh, a coarse-fidelity fixture, an unread column line, an unread\nrectangle (inside-out shell), a sub-cell footprint and a budget cut\nmid-line keep the box verdict; a face on a column centre where the\nmaterial ends is contact; a far-off line is nudged by a capped step.\n\nRefs #1530\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
